gbm — free background music collection
======================================

THE AUDIO FILES IN THIS REPOSITORY ARE NOT LICENSED UNDER A SINGLE REPOSITORY LICENSE.

Each file under music/ keeps the licence its author released it under. The licence of every file is recorded in
tracks.json (field "license", with the full name and URL in the top-level "licenses" table) and in CREDITS.md.
The files are unmodified copies of the originals.

Licences used in this collection:

  • CC0 1.0 (Public Domain Dedication) — https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
      No attribution required (credit is appreciated).

  • CC BY 3.0 / CC BY 4.0 (Attribution) — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/
                                         https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
      You must give appropriate credit (title, author, source, licence and a link to it), and indicate if you made
      changes. The ready-made credit line of each track is in tracks.json ("attribution") and CREDITS.md.

No file under a NonCommercial (NC) or NoDerivatives (ND) licence is included.

A Creative Commons licence covers the copyright the author holds. It does not stop automated systems (for example
YouTube Content ID) from occasionally flagging a track; keep the credit line and the source link to dispute a claim.

Everything else in this repository (scripts/, README.md, tracks.json structure, CREDITS.md layout) is released under
CC0 1.0 — https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
